---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PersonCard from '../components/PersonCard.astro';
import EventRow from '../components/EventRow.astro';
import {people,events} from '../lib/catalog';
---
<Base>
<section class="shell hero">
<div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>一部史书，许多种读法</div><h1>读懂人物，<br/>看见历史的<br/><em>来龙去脉。</em></h1><p>从一人一事走进《三国志》。<br/>先读故事，再循着正文与裴注，找到依据。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/people/">从人物开始 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/events/">沿事件探索 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="hero-stats"><div><strong>{people.length}</strong><span>人物入口</span></div><div><strong>{events.length}</strong><span>历史事件</span></div><div><strong>65</strong><span>原文卷目</span></div></div></div>
<div class="hero-art" aria-label="三国志阅读入口"><div class="art-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="art-title" lang="zh-Hant" aria-hidden="true">三國志</div><span class="art-edition">陳壽撰<br/>裴松之注</span><div class="art-circle" aria-hidden="true"></div><a class="art-person" href="/people/caocao/"><span class="mini-eyebrow">人物 / 曹魏</span><strong>曹操</strong><span>字孟德 · 从汉臣到魏王</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a><a class="art-event" href="/events/chibi/"><span class="mini-eyebrow">事件 / 建安十三年</span><strong>赤壁之战</strong><span>一次联合，改变南方局势。</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a><span class="art-bottom">纪 · 传 · 注 / READ THE SOURCES</span></div>
</section>
<div class="intro-band"><div class="shell"><span class="intro-seal">读</span><p>人物有来处，事件有前因。<br class="mobile-only"/>每张卡片，都能回到原文。</p><a href="/about/">了解这份文本 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
<section class="shell home-section start-section" aria-labelledby="start-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-eyebrow">从哪里读起</div><h2 id="start-title">按你的习惯，选一个入口</h2></div></div><div class="start-grid">
<a class="start-card" href="/people/"><span class="start-no">甲</span><span class="start-for">初次接触</span><strong>读人物故事</strong><p>从曹操、刘备、诸葛亮这样的名字开始，先读一个人的一生，再顺着他走进事件。</p><span class="start-go">看 {people.length} 位人物 <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></span></a>
<a class="start-card" href="/events/"><span class="start-no">乙</span><span class="start-for">想看来龙去脉</span><strong>沿事件线读</strong><p>从黄巾起事到三国归晋，按年代和曹魏、蜀汉、孙吴、诸侯四条线，看清事情怎样一步步发生。</p><span class="start-go">看 {events.length} 个事件 <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></span></a>
<a class="start-card" href="/read/"><span class="start-no">丙</span><span class="start-for">想读原书</span><strong>翻开全书目录</strong><p>陈寿正文与裴松之注，可切换简体、繁体，也有 AI 辅助的白话试译，能逐段对照原文。</p><span class="start-go">65 卷全文 <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></span></a>
</div></section>
<section class="shell home-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-eyebrow">01 / 以人为入口</div><h2>先认识几位故人</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/people/">全部人物 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="person-grid">{[people[0],people[2],people[3],people[4]].map((person,index)=><PersonCard person={person} index={index}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="shell home-section events-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-eyebrow">02 / 看清局势变化</div><h2>从汉末动荡，到三国归晋</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/events/">全部事件 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="event-list">{events.filter(e=>['yellow-turbans','dong-zhuo-capital','guandu','chibi','wei-founding','shu-founding','wu-emperor','fall-shu','jin-founding','fall-wu'].includes(e.id)).sort((a,b)=>a.year-b.year||a.endYear-b.endYear).map(event=><EventRow event={event}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="shell reading-invite"><div><div class="section-eyebrow">03 / 回到文字本身</div><h2>故事之外，<br/>史料还有更丰富的声音。</h2><p>陈寿的正文，裴松之补入的记载。<br/>保留不同层次，让理解有据可循。</p></div><div class="reading-invite-side"><span class="vertical-quote" aria-hidden="true">開卷有益</span><a class="button button-dark" href="/read/">打开全书目录 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>65 卷 +《上三国志注表》</small></div></section>
</Base>
